   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att effektivisera sociala sektorn i Moldavien. Kunskapsutveckling ing&#xe5;r f&#xf6;r ledningen och socialarbetare vid tre institutioner f&#xf6;r handikappade barn - nyf&#xf6;dda samt 0-18 &#xe5;r.  Studiebes&#xf6;k i Sverige.  Lennart Lundqvist Consulting utf&#xf6;r uppdraget.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective is to effetivise the social sector in Moldova.  Capacity building for the leadership and social workers in 3 institutions for handicapped children, newly born and 0-18 yrs. Study visit to Sweden.  Lennart Lundqvist Consulting is the Swedish partner.</narrative>
